{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13281","headline":"闲居作 · 皇甫冉","name":"闲居作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多病辞官罢，闲居作赋成。\n图书唯药籙，饮食止藜羹。\n学谢淹中术，诗无邺下名。\n不堪趋建礼，讵是厌承明。\n已辍金门步，方从石路行。\n远山期道士，高柳觅先生。\n性懒尤因疾，家贫自省营。\n种苗虽尚短，谷价幸全轻。\n篇咏投康乐，壶觞就步兵。\n何人肯相访，开户一逢迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}